# Optional online features. Leave all of these unset for the submitted static build.
#
# Enable the /api/leaderboard probe (requires a server or Vercel function):
# VITE_LEADERBOARD_API=true
#
# Online mode only activates when the endpoint has durable storage. Point it at a
# Vercel KV / Upstash Redis REST database:
# LEADERBOARD_KV_REST_URL=https://your-db.upstash.io
# LEADERBOARD_KV_REST_TOKEN=your-token
#
# Without those the endpoint answers storage: "unavailable" and the game keeps its
# on-device Hall of Fame. Online scores are self-reported, not cheat-proof.
#
# Send optional gameplay telemetry to an endpoint you own:
# VITE_ANALYTICS_URL=https://example.com/api/analytics
